{{apichanges|9.0.1|prev=8.3.7|next=9.0.2}}

==Summary==
Patch 9.0.1 is the pre-patch for Shadowlands API and systems.
* TOC: <code>90001</code>
* {{api|t=o|Frame}}s no longer provide any form of [[API_Frame_SetBackdrop|Backdrop API]] by default. See [https://github.com/Stanzilla/WoWUIBugs/wiki/9.0.1-Consolidated-UI-Changes#backdrop-system-changes Backdrop System Changes].
* Various <code>LE_*</code> enumerations have been moved to the global <code>Enum</code> table. See [https://github.com/Stanzilla/WoWUIBugs/wiki/9.0.1-Consolidated-UI-Changes#enum-changes Enum Changes].
* APIs deprecated during the lifetime of 8.x and present within the Blizzard_Deprecated addon have been removed. See [https://github.com/Stanzilla/WoWUIBugs/wiki/9.0.1-Consolidated-UI-Changes#deprecated-api-removals Deprecated API Removals].
* New files and [[TOC format]] metadata changes no longer require a client restart to take effect, only a [[MACRO reload|/reload]] (on Windows).
* The <code>|r</code> [[UI_escape_sequences|escape sequence]] now pops nested <code>|c</code> color sequences in-order, instead of resetting the text to the default color.

==Resources==
* Diffs: [https://github.com/Gethe/wow-ui-source/compare/8.3.7...9.0.1 wow-ui-source], [https://github.com/Ketho/BlizzardInterfaceResources/compare/8.3.7...9.0.1 BlizzardInterfaceResources]
* Official patch notes: [https://worldofwarcraft.com/en-us/news/23529209/shadowlands-pre-expansion-patch-notes#item13 Shadowlands Pre-Expansion Patch Notes]
* Community patch notes: [https://github.com/Stanzilla/WoWUIBugs/wiki/9.0.1-Consolidated-UI-Changes 9.0.1 Consolidated UI Changes]

